direction: right
title: Four Enterprise Caching Patterns

P1: 1. Cache-Aside (Lazy) {
  style.fill: "#0B132B"
  style.stroke: "#0284C7"
  desc: "App checks cache -> reads DB on miss -> updates cache"
}

P2: 2. Read-Through {
  style.fill: "#06201B"
  style.stroke: "#10B981"
  desc: "App reads from cache -> cache library fetches DB transparently"
}

P3: 3. Write-Through {
  style.fill: "#1C1917"
  style.stroke: "#F59E0B"
  desc: "App writes cache -> cache synchronously writes DB"
}

P4: 4. Write-Behind (Write-Back) {
  style.fill: "#1E1B4B"
  style.stroke: "#8B5CF6"
  desc: "App writes cache (fast) -> async background queue drains batch to DB"
}
